# Numerology Calculator Making

This repository explains the basic logic behind creating a simple **Pythagorean numerology calculator**.

In Pythagorean numerology, letters are assigned numerical values from 1 to 9. These values can be combined and reduced to help calculate numbers associated with a person's name, including the Expression Number.

## What This Project Covers

* Pythagorean letter-to-number values
* Name numerology calculations
* Number reduction methods
* Master Numbers 11, 22, and 33
* Simple examples for understanding the calculation process

## Try a Numerology Calculator

If you want to calculate a name number without doing the arithmetic manually, you can use this [numerology calculator](https://calculadoranumerologia.com/) to explore the result.

